px] text-slate-500 min-w-0 break-words order-last lg:order-none">Model: Pollinations OpenAI | Inputs: text | Context: 2 msgs | generate</div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap"><button class="chat-token-control-btn chat-focus-ring inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 transition-colors text-xs font-bold disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path></svg> Retry</button><button class="chat-token-control-btn-danger chat-focus-ring inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 transition-colors text-xs font-bold disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed" disabled=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-square"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect></svg> Stop</button></div></div></div></div></div></div><aside id="chat-session-panel" class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full sm:w-[92vw] max-w-96 lg:w-96 border-l border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/30 backdrop-blur-md shadow-2xl z-20 chat-motion-panel flex flex-col min-h-0 translate-x-full opacity-0"><div class="p-4 border-b border-slate-800/80 bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-between shrink-0"><h2 class="text-sm font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-history text-indigo-400"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path><path d="M12 7v5l4 2"></pat